usage: plot_split_explicit_results.py [-h]
                                      [--dynamics {compressible_explicit,compressible_splitexplicit}]
                                      [--comm {MPI,NCCL}] [--compare-comm]
                                      [--output-prefix OUTPUT_PREFIX]
                                      [--time-step TIME_STEP]
                                      [--warmup-steps WARMUP_STEPS]
                                      [--substeps SUBSTEPS]
                                      csv

Plot explicit or split-explicit timing and efficiency from a benchmark CSV.

positional arguments:
  csv

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --dynamics {compressible_explicit,compressible_splitexplicit}
  --comm {MPI,NCCL}
  --compare-comm        Compare MPI and NCCL weak scaling
  --output-prefix OUTPUT_PREFIX
  --time-step TIME_STEP
  --warmup-steps WARMUP_STEPS
  --substeps SUBSTEPS
